    "created_at": "2019-05-01T05:42:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-01T05:42:07Z",
    "body": "Well, but again, for any nested `template` elements it'll be effectively that, with this design (having to wait for `DOMContentLoaded`). And if the primary motivation is shadow roots, that does not necessarily seem great for incremental rendering.",
